name:           betzac
version:        0.1.0.0
synopsis:       Compiler of betza notation, a language for esoteric chess pieces
description:    Betzac is a compiler for betza notation, a description language for the movement
                of chess variant pieces. It handles multi-file projects with @using@ imports,
                label scoping and overrides, and a standard prelude of primitive leapers,
                reporting diagnostics the way a conventional compiler does.
                .
                The package also provides @bls@, a Language Server Protocol implementation
                giving diagnostics, semantic highlighting and go-to-definition in any LSP editor.
                .
                Please see the README on GitHub at <https://github.com/betza-lang/betzac#readme>
category:       Compiler, Game
homepage:       https://github.com/betza-lang/betzac#readme
bug-reports:    https://github.com/betza-lang/betzac/issues
author:         Thierry Poulin
